# [free_energy] (D161) with the prolate kernel of PME (D266) on
# the CPU, scenario prolate of Inputs/check_free_energy.py: ethanol
# decoupled from TIP3P (Inputs/fep). dH/dλ of the Coulomb, the
# Lennard-Jones, and a component of expressions against central differences
# of the energies of the states beside it; the energies of the other states
# against runs at those states; and λ = 0 against the run without
# [free_energy], in double and mixed precision.
#
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check_free_energy.py %t CPU DOUBLE mdir prolate | FileCheck %s
# RUN: rm -rf %t-mixed && mkdir -p %t-mixed
# RUN: %python %S/Inputs/check_free_energy.py %t-mixed CPU MIXED mdir prolate | FileCheck %s
#
# CHECK: dH/dl against central differences: ok
# CHECK: the energies of the other states: ok
# CHECK: lambda = 0 against no [free_energy]: ok
# CHECK: free energy prolate passed
